  "solution": "The pattern followed here is :\n\n1) 63 - 30 = 30\n\n(6 + 3) - (3 + 0)\n\n9 – 3 = 6\n\n6 × 5 = 30\n\n2) 72 – 10 = 40\n\n(7 + 2) – (1 + 0)\n\n9 – 1 = 8\n\n8 × 5 = 40\n\nSimilarly,\n\n3) 81 – 60 =?\n\n(8 + 1) – (6 + 0)\n\n9 – 6 = 3\n\n3 × 5 = 15\n\n? = 15\n\nHence, ‘15’ is the correct answer.",
